<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="en">

<head>

    <meta charset="UTF-8">

    <meta
        name="viewport"
        content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"
    >

    <title>Standora — Location report</title>

    <style>

        body {
            font-family:
                -apple-system,
                BlinkMacSystemFont,
                "Segoe UI",
                sans-serif;

            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            padding: 0 24px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #21314e;
            background: #f3f6fb;
        }

        h1 {
            margin-bottom: 4px;
        }

        .subtitle {
            color: #666;
            margin-top: 0;
        }

        .profile {
            padding: 20px;
            border: 1px solid #dde5f0;
            background: white;
            border-radius: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }

        th,
        td {
            padding: 12px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd;
            text-align: left;
        }

        th {
            background: #edf2fa;
        }

        .score {
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .location {
            padding: 20px;
            border: 1px solid #dde5f0;
            background: white;
            border-radius: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 18px;
        }

        details {
            margin-top: 12px;
        }

        summary {
            cursor: pointer;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .signal {
            margin: 12px 0;
        }

        .footer {
            margin-top: 50px;
            color: #777;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        h1 { color: #223e70; font-size: 38px; letter-spacing: -1.5px; }
        h2 { color: #223e70; }
        .profile { border-top: 4px solid #223e70; }
        .score { color: #223e70; }
        .footer { border-top: 1px solid #dde5f0; padding-top: 20px; }
        @media print { body { background: white; margin: 0; } details > * { display: block; } .location { break-inside: avoid; } }
        @media (max-width: 650px) { body { padding: 0 12px; } table { font-size: 10px; } th, td { padding: 8px 4px; } }
        .chart-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:220px 1fr 45px;gap:14px;align-items:center;margin:16px 0;font-size:13px}.track{height:18px;background:#edf2fa;border-radius:5px;position:relative}.track>div{height:100%;border-radius:4px}.stacked{display:flex}.stacked>div{border-radius:0}.budget-track i{position:absolute;top:-4px;bottom:-4px;border-left:2px dashed #172b50}.rent-row{margin:22px 0}.rent-row>span{display:block;font-size:13px;margin:5px 0 9px}.legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px;font-size:12px}.legend i{display:inline-block;width:10px;height:10px;margin-right:6px}.chart-row b{text-align:right}@media(max-width:650px){.chart-row{grid-template-columns:1fr 45px;gap:7px}.chart-row>span{grid-column:1/-1}}@media print{.track,.legend i{-webkit-print-color-adjust:exact;print-color-adjust:exact}}
    </style>

</head>


<body>

<h1>Standora</h1>

<p class="subtitle">
    LOCATION INTELLIGENCE · Explainable recommendation report
</p>


<section class="profile">

    <h2>Business Profile</h2>

    <p>
        <strong>Industry:</strong>
        {{ profile.branche }}
    </p>

    <p>
        <strong>Required area:</strong>
        {{ profile.flaeche_m2 }} m²
    </p>

    <p>
        <strong>Target group:</strong>
        {{ profile.zielgruppe }}
    </p>

    <p>
        <strong>Monthly rent budget:</strong>
        €{{ "%.0f"|format(profile.budget_miete_eur) }}
    </p>

    <p>
        <strong>Preferred region:</strong>
        {{ profile.region_praeferenz if profile.region_praeferenz is string else profile.region_praeferenz | join(', ') }}
    </p>

</section>


{% if rankings %}
{% set best = rankings[0] %}
<section class="location"><h2>Your strongest match: {{ best.municipality.gemeinde }}</h2>
<p>{{ best.municipality.bundesland }} · Overall suitability {{ "%.1f"|format(best.total_score) }}/100</p>
<p><strong>Estimated monthly rent:</strong> €{{ "%.0f"|format(best.municipality.mietindex_eur_m2 * profile.flaeche_m2) }} · <strong>Dataset population:</strong> {{ "{:,}".format(best.municipality.einwohner) }}</p>
</section>
<section class="location"><h2>Compare your top locations</h2><p>Raw signal scores on the same 0–100 scale.</p>
{% for key, label, color in signals %}<h3>{{ label }}</h3>{% for result in rankings[:3] %}<div class="chart-row"><span>{{ result.municipality.gemeinde }}</span><div class="track"><div style="width:{{ result.signals[key].score }}%;background:{{ color }}"></div></div><b>{{ "%.1f"|format(result.signals[key].score) }}</b></div>{% endfor %}{% endfor %}
</section>
<section class="location"><h2>Does the rent fit your budget?</h2><p>Illustrative monthly rent for {{ profile.flaeche_m2 }} m². Monthly budget: €{{ "%.0f"|format(profile.budget_miete_eur) }}.</p>
{% for result in rankings[:5] %}{% set rent = result.municipality.mietindex_eur_m2 * profile.flaeche_m2 %}<div class="rent-row"><strong>{{ result.municipality.gemeinde }}</strong><span>€{{ "%.0f"|format(rent) }} · €{{ "%.0f"|format((profile.budget_miete_eur - rent)|abs) }} {{ 'above budget' if rent > profile.budget_miete_eur else 'headroom' }}</span><div class="track budget-track"><div style="width:{{ rent / rent_max * 100 }}%;background:{{ '#d5983e' if rent > profile.budget_miete_eur else '#3558a7' }}"></div><i style="left:{{ profile.budget_miete_eur / rent_max * 100 }}%"></i></div></div>{% endfor %}
<p>Rent index × floor area. Synthetic estimates, rather than property listings.</p></section>
<section class="location"><h2>What puts a location ahead?</h2><p>Each segment shows its contribution after industry weighting.</p><div class="legend">{% for key, label, color in signals %}<span><i style="background:{{ color }}"></i>{{ label }} · {{ (weights[key] * 100)|round|int }}%</span>{% endfor %}</div>
{% for result in rankings[:10] %}<div class="chart-row"><span>{{ result.municipality.gemeinde }}</span><div class="track stacked">{% for key, label, color in signals %}<div style="width:{{ result.signals[key].score * weights[key] }}%;background:{{ color }}" title="{{ label }}: {{ '%.1f'|format(result.signals[key].score * weights[key]) }} points"></div>{% endfor %}</div><b>{{ "%.1f"|format(result.total_score) }}</b></div>{% endfor %}</section>
{% endif %}
<h2>The full ranking</h2>

<table>

    <thead>

        <tr>
            <th>Rank</th>
            <th>Municipality</th>
            <th>Overall</th>
            <th>Customer fit</th>
            <th>Surrounding activity</th>
            <th>Rent</th>
            <th>Public transport</th>
        </tr>

    </thead>

    <tbody>

    {% for result in top_results %}

        <tr>

            <td>
                #{{ loop.index }}
            </td>

            <td>
                {{ result.municipality.gemeinde }}
            </td>

            <td class="score">
                {{ "%.1f"|format(result.total_score) }}
            </td>

            <td>
                {{ "%.1f"|format(
                    result.signals["demographics"].score
                ) }}
            </td>

            <td>
                {{ "%.1f"|format(
                    result.signals["poi"].score
                ) }}
            </td>

            <td>
                {{ "%.1f"|format(
                    result.signals["rent"].score
                ) }}
            </td>

            <td>
                {{ "%.1f"|format(
                    result.signals["transit"].score
                ) }}
            </td>

        </tr>

    {% endfor %}

    </tbody>

</table>


<h2>Location summaries & evidence</h2>


{% for result in top_results %}

<section class="location">

    <h3>
        #{{ loop.index }}
        {{ result.municipality.gemeinde }}
    </h3>

    <p>
        <strong>
            Overall score:
        </strong>

        {{ "%.1f"|format(result.total_score) }}/100
    </p>


    <p>{{ result.municipality.bundesland }} · Population: {{ "{:,}".format(result.municipality.einwohner) }} · Estimated monthly rent: €{{ "%.0f"|format(result.municipality.mietindex_eur_m2 * profile.flaeche_m2) }}</p>
    <details open>

        <summary>
            Show signal explanations
        </summary>


        <div class="signal">

            <strong>
                Customer fit —
                {{ "%.1f"|format(
                    result.signals["demographics"].score
                ) }}/100
            </strong>

            <p>
                {{ result.signals["demographics"].reason }}
            </p>

        </div>


        <div class="signal">

            <strong>
                Surrounding activity —
                {{ "%.1f"|format(
                    result.signals["poi"].score
                ) }}/100
            </strong>

            <p>
                {{ result.signals["poi"].reason }}
            </p>

        </div>


        <div class="signal">

            <strong>
                Rent —
                {{ "%.1f"|format(
                    result.signals["rent"].score
                ) }}/100
            </strong>

            <p>
                {{ result.signals["rent"].reason }}
            </p>

        </div>


        <div class="signal">

            <strong>
                Public transport —
                {{ "%.1f"|format(
                    result.signals["transit"].score
                ) }}/100
            </strong>

            <p>
                {{ result.signals["transit"].reason }}
            </p>

        </div>

    </details>

</section>

{% endfor %}


{% if customer_explanation %}
<section class="location">
    <h2>What this means for your business</h2>
    {% for paragraph in customer_explanation.split('\n\n') %}
    <p>{{ paragraph }}</p>
    {% endfor %}
</section>
{% endif %}



<section class="location"><h2>How it works</h2><p>Python normalises four signals using the full dataset and combines them with industry-specific weights. Regional preferences filter candidates. Budget influences suitability; it does not exclude locations.</p><p>Surrounding activity reflects nearby shops, services and amenities, rather than measured footfall or direct competitor counts. AI, when configured, interprets the evidence without changing the ranking.</p></section>
<p class="footer">

    Scores are decision-support indicators based on the
    supplied synthetic municipality dataset (20 municipalities / districts, June 2026) and should not be
    interpreted as official location advice.

</p>

</body>

</html>
